# SYNTHETIC distributed temperature survey for Kestrel A-7 (a design, not a drilled well).
# Generated from Ramey's flowing temperature with a hidden rock conductivity and 0.35 degF gauge noise.
~Version Information
 VERS.          2.0                         : CWLS LOG ASCII STANDARD - VERSION 2.0
 WRAP.          NO                          : One line per index step
~Well Information
 STRT.M         0                           : First index value
 STOP.M         2834                        : Last index value
 STEP.M         2                           : Step
 NULL.          -999.25                     : Null value
 WELL.          Kestrel A-7                 : Well name
 FLD.           Kestrel                     : Field
 COMP.          Example Energy              : Operator
 SRVC.          SYNTHETIC DTS               : Service company
 DATE.          2024-03-31                  : Survey date
~Curve Information
 DEPT.M                                     : Measured depth
 TEMP.DEGF                                  : Fibre temperature, tubing
~Parameter Information
 TPROD.H        720                         : Time on production at the survey
 QLIQ.STB/D     9230                        : Liquid rate during the survey
 WCUT.FRAC      0.050                       : Water cut during the survey
 PRODMD.M       2834                        : Producing depth, MD
 FIBER.         tubing-conveyed             : Fibre deployment
